Before doing anything in this repository, read `CLAUDE.md` at the repository root and
follow it exactly. It begins with a workflow question shown in an ASCII box. Show that
question first, in a code block, and wait for the answer. Do not read other project
files, start work or write files until the user has answered.

That file is the single canonical workflow instruction for every tool. This rule only
points to it and adds nothing.
